cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the measurements it contains, please cite both the paper and this archive."
title: "Batch Size and Calling Interface in Gradient Boosted Tree Serving: replication package"
abstract: >-
  Replication package for a study measuring per-row inference latency of LightGBM,
  XGBoost and CatBoost across nine serving interfaces and thirteen batch sizes at three
  model sizes, on a single thread, with two independent runs.
